# Local secrets. This integration's build context is its OWN directory
# (compose: `build: ./integrations/mastra`), so the repo-root .dockerignore —
# which does exclude **/.env — is NOT applied here. The Dockerfile does
# `COPY . .`, so without these two lines a developer's integrations/mastra/.env
# (the file .env.example invites them to create) is baked into an image layer
# with real API keys. Matches langgraph-typescript.
.env
.env.local
